Winnow builds on software and data made by others. None of it is redistributed in this repository:

- OpenCV 5 (Apache-2.0), including cv2.dnn, img_hash and SIFT.
- MobileNetV2 (Apache-2.0), from the OpenCV Zoo (huggingface.co/opencv/image_classification_mobilenet).
  The Dockerfile downloads it at build time and winnow/models/make_embedder.py strips its classifier
  layer to make the embedder. The weights are not stored in this repository.
- Imagenette (fast.ai; images from ImageNet), used only for the evaluations in imagenette_exp/.
  The photos are not included, only file names in the audit results. ImageNet has its own terms of use.
- boto3 and the AWS SDKs (Apache-2.0).
